  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Innovative Mechanisms for Industrial Energy Efficiency Financing in Indonesia with Lessons for Replication in other ASEAN Member States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is a de-risking, financing and technical assistance facility aiming to catalyse the industrial energy efficiency market in Indonesia and its neighbouring Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN) countries.

&#x2022; The credit guarantee from GCF to LFIs, combined with capacity-building support develops the local market for financing energy efficiency projects.
&#x2022; It will create more demand for energy efficiency projects in high-emitting industrial sectors by reducing the risk premium and consequently the interest rate, particularly for small and medium-sized enterprises, and developing energy savings insurance.
&#x2022; It supports the development of new business models and more conducive regulations for energy efficiency investments in Indonesia, with knowledge-sharing to other ASEAN countries.</narrative>
  </description>
